Authors
-------

This fork (5.0 and later)
  John D. Lewis (AI3I) - https://github.com/AI3I/chan_sccp

Original authors and earlier maintainers
  chan_sccp was written by Sergio Chersovani (Zozo), based on chan_skinny, and
  later modified by Jan Czmok and Julien Goodwin. Chan-SCCP-b, the project this
  fork continues, was developed by Marcello Ceschia, Diederik de Groot and
  many contributors.

  The legacy project, its contributor list and its history are at
  https://github.com/chan-sccp/chan-sccp

Authorship of individual files is recorded in their headers and in the git
history.
